{"problem_id": "b1099201-efbd-4bf7-961e-6ee9dda4b8e3", "transformations": {"schema_version": 3, "revision": 11, "items": [{"at": "2026-08-27T10:45:52.828852+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "assets"}, "value": {"alt": "", "url": "/assets/11990321-9998-41c8-82a2-d81846e7cd6b", "html": "<img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"11990321-9998-41c8-82a2-d81846e7cd6b\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\" src=\"/assets/11990321-9998-41c8-82a2-d81846e7cd6b\"/>", "kind": "ordinary_image", "asset_id": "11990321-9998-41c8-82a2-d81846e7cd6b", "position": 0, "asset_key": "image_1", "parent_target_id": "section:condition:1"}, "operation": "rewrite", "transformation_target_id": "asset:image_1"}, {"at": "2026-08-27T10:45:52.828852+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "assets"}, "value": {"alt": "", "url": "/assets/367fdcde-f4d4-44f0-bcda-74e551ff84a0", "html": "<img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"367fdcde-f4d4-44f0-bcda-74e551ff84a0\" data-asset-key=\"image_2\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_2\" src=\"/assets/367fdcde-f4d4-44f0-bcda-74e551ff84a0\"/>", "kind": "ordinary_image", "asset_id": "367fdcde-f4d4-44f0-bcda-74e551ff84a0", "position": 0, "asset_key": "image_2", "parent_target_id": "section:solution:1"}, "operation": "rewrite", "transformation_target_id": "asset:image_2"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T15:53:04.211202+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "value": {"html": "<p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"11990321-9998-41c8-82a2-d81846e7cd6b\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\"/>На ри­сун­ке изоб­ра­жен гра­фик функ­ции <i>f</i>(<i>x</i>) и ка­са­тель­ная к этому гра­фи­ку, про­ведённая в точке <i>x</i><sub>0</sub>. Най­ди­те зна­че­ние про­из­вод­ной функ­ции <i>f</i>(<i>x</i>) в точке <i>x</i><sub>0</sub>.</p>", "title": "Условие", "asset_keys": ["image_1"]}, "operation": "rewrite", "transformation_target_id": "section:condition:1"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T15:53:04.211202+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "value": {"html": "<p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"367fdcde-f4d4-44f0-bcda-74e551ff84a0\" data-asset-key=\"image_2\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_2\"/></p><p>Зна­че­ние про­из­вод­ной в точке ка­са­ния равно уг­ло­во­му ко­эф­фи­ци­ен­ту ка­са­тель­ной, ко­то­рый в свою оче­редь равен тан­ген­су угла на­кло­на дан­ной ка­са­тель­ной к оси абс­цисс. По­стро­им тре­уголь­ник с вер­ши­на­ми в точ­ках  <span data-inline-latex=\"A(-1;-3)\"></span> ,  <span data-inline-latex=\"B(-1;-7)\"></span> ,  <span data-inline-latex=\"C(0;-7)\"></span> . Угол на­кло­на ка­са­тель­ной к оси абс­цисс будет равен углу, смеж­но­му с углом <var data-math-identifier=\"ACB\">ACB</var>, по­это­му</p><center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"y'(x_0)=\\tg (180^{\\circ}-\\angle ACB)=-\\tg \\angle ACB=-\\frac{AB}{BC}=-\\frac{4}{1}=-4\"></span>. </p></center>", "title": "Решение", "asset_keys": ["image_2"]}, "operation": "rewrite", "transformation_target_id": "section:solution:1"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T15:53:04.211202+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "operation": "remove", "transformation_target_id": "asset:formula_1"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T15:53:04.211202+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "operation": "remove", "transformation_target_id": "asset:formula_2"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T15:53:04.211202+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "operation": "remove", "transformation_target_id": "asset:formula_3"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T15:53:04.211202+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "operation": "remove", "transformation_target_id": "asset:formula_4"}]}, "normalized_content": {"assets": [{"alt": "", "url": "/assets/11990321-9998-41c8-82a2-d81846e7cd6b", "kind": "ordinary_image", "asset_id": "11990321-9998-41c8-82a2-d81846e7cd6b", "asset_key": "image_1", "transformation_target_id": "asset:image_1"}, {"alt": "", "url": "/assets/367fdcde-f4d4-44f0-bcda-74e551ff84a0", "kind": "ordinary_image", "asset_id": "367fdcde-f4d4-44f0-bcda-74e551ff84a0", "asset_key": "image_2", "transformation_target_id": "asset:image_2"}], "format": "teacherhelper-normalized", "sections": [{"key": "condition", "html": "<p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"11990321-9998-41c8-82a2-d81846e7cd6b\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\" src=\"/assets/11990321-9998-41c8-82a2-d81846e7cd6b\"/>На ри­сун­ке изоб­ра­жен гра­фик функ­ции <i>f</i>(<i>x</i>) и ка­са­тель­ная к этому гра­фи­ку, про­ведённая в точке <i>x</i><sub>0</sub>. Най­ди­те зна­че­ние про­из­вод­ной функ­ции <i>f</i>(<i>x</i>) в точке <i>x</i><sub>0</sub>.</p>", "title": "Условие", "asset_keys": ["image_1"], "section_id": "condition:1", "transformation_target_id": "section:condition:1"}, {"key": "answer", "html": "<p><span data-effect=\"spaced\">-4</span></p>", "title": "Ответ", "asset_keys": [], "section_id": "answer:1", "transformation_target_id": "section:answer:1"}, {"key": "source", "html": "<p>Источник: <a href=\"https://math-ege.sdamgia.ru/test?id=23006323\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Пробный ЕГЭ по математике, Санкт-Петербург, 19.03.2019. Вариант 1</a></p><p>Источник: <a href=\"https://math-ege.sdamgia.ru/test?id=84733585\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">ЕГЭ−2025. Основная волна 27.05.2025. Сибирь. Вариант Школково</a></p>", "title": "Источник", "asset_keys": [], "section_id": "source:1", "transformation_target_id": "section:source:1"}, {"key": "solution", "html": "<p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"367fdcde-f4d4-44f0-bcda-74e551ff84a0\" data-asset-key=\"image_2\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_2\" src=\"/assets/367fdcde-f4d4-44f0-bcda-74e551ff84a0\"/></p><p>Зна­че­ние про­из­вод­ной в точке ка­са­ния равно уг­ло­во­му ко­эф­фи­ци­ен­ту ка­са­тель­ной, ко­то­рый в свою оче­редь равен тан­ген­су угла на­кло­на дан­ной ка­са­тель­ной к оси абс­цисс. По­стро­им тре­уголь­ник с вер­ши­на­ми в точ­ках  <span data-inline-latex=\"A(-1;-3)\"></span> ,  <span data-inline-latex=\"B(-1;-7)\"></span> ,  <span data-inline-latex=\"C(0;-7)\"></span> . Угол на­кло­на ка­са­тель­ной к оси абс­цисс будет равен углу, смеж­но­му с углом <var data-math-identifier=\"ACB\">ACB</var>, по­это­му</p><center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"y'(x_0)=\\tg (180^{\\circ}-\\angle ACB)=-\\tg \\angle ACB=-\\frac{AB}{BC}=-\\frac{4}{1}=-4\"></span>. </p></center>", "title": "Решение", "asset_keys": ["image_2"], "section_id": "solution:1", "transformation_target_id": "section:solution:1"}], "schema_version": 3, "problem_reference_ids": {"prototype_problem_id": null, "group_parent_problem_id": null, "adjacent_group_parent_problem_id": null}}}